<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-15T17:53:41.069Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:53:41 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese Armed Forces have captured Al-Khuwai in West Kordofan and are advancing toward Al-Nahud, while the Rapid Support Forces continue to use drones to strike civilian areas in West Kordofan, the Blue Nile, and power stations, plunging cities into darkness. Humanitarian aid is deteriorating, with food assistance cut for 900,000 people and civilians fleeing towns such as Abu Zabad. A suspected chemical weapons storage site was reported at Sudanese army facilities, and the RSF-led government is planning to use the port of Togo for western Sudan trade. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxORHVrVmJvSHRrc0FGaVNUaFBJd2txbFV1bVdqTm9kTERkT1lXb2lxRl80YzNpUndaeDUzb1Y2V1NnU21fV2w3TmR6RkNUbVhuVnBEaFAwQnc5Ymd4VWtDczZ1emE0Y2RyRnVPblFjWXVkLWVzcTN4VFY3S3FKcWNqdDlOLWlIanRYb0c3blVvZEN5eXJWa191V2RZWUEtVTdDLWhCZ1NVQlB1ak9zM3BBTllpQ0s0QW1WbXFxMWZ3QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOWXVTdmpMaE8xQjVDejhla3FQS3JuR1NjaW1TeGswMGlvVkpwNFRMVTliLWV6TG9zWk1DN1Z0b2NSQUpwYkNfMEJ4dW9jdWJWX0JvbVp6VFI0eHZWYjNDZEJvaXZ0UURXN3lUV216aWJBeHJIelh0WEhEam9QM2cwdXB0c3BzRVhNdVR3dkxMWTMtalR3amVUNE5UMk9mbTA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPY0NVdl9leVpMc2k4WGgtWWRHR2pSeTRFMHY3MzNydmVqcXNpMWlOMmV6M1ZhcXFGZ1Q1VGJjQ2dUNEd1ckRZNXlaSXVpQU9ZVnNMcUlJYWstMnc2SVB6QUV3aEFYMXg1MTVtN2pDaUszQlUzdG5WMU1VRlJvV1BBUDVqZzJJYXRHYnlVUmFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Arab&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot